      "id": "claim_5734a02dbb0b4dd18ad09eb47d9be879",
      "statement": "QuickJS releases slot resources on ordinary `after_agent` completion; when interruption or a tool error skips that hook, middleware garbage collection best-effort closes remaining slots, while process finalization deliberately avoids waiting on workers to prevent interpreter-exit deadlock. Shutdown tests cover normal completion, interruption, tool error, and garbage collection.",
